{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26672","headline":"早春山居寄城中知己 · 姚合","name":"早春山居寄城中知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳和潜发荡寒阴，便使川原景象深。\n入户风泉声沥沥，当轩云岫影沈沈。\n残云带雨轻飘雪，嫩柳含烟小绽金。\n虽有眼前诗酒兴，邀游争得称闲心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}